<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>智能新闻| smithsonianmag.com</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/rss/smart-news/</link><description>智能新闻的 RSS 提要</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 01:33:37 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>音频工程师在先锋“蓝调之母”的新歌曲宝库中恢复了隐藏的音符并揭示了丢失的乐器</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/audio-engineers-restored-hidden-notes-and-revealed-lost-instruments-in-this-new-treasure-trove-of-songs-by-the-pioneering-mother-of-the-blues-180989228/</link><description>该专辑收录了 118 首曲目，是美国蓝调偶像 Ma Rainey 录制的最完整的一套唱片</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 20:14:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/audio-engineers-restored-hidden-notes-and-revealed-lost-instruments-in-this-new-treasure-trove-of-songs-by-the-pioneering-mother-of-the-blues-180989228/</guid></item><item><title>一种奇怪的、前所未见的癌症似乎正在新英格兰湖的鲶鱼中传播</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-strange-never-before-seen-cancer-seems-to-be-spreading-among-catfish-in-a-new-england-lake-180989195/</link><description>十多年前，渔民和生物学家注意到门弗雷梅戈格湖的棕色牛头鲶鱼的皮肤上有乌黑的肿瘤。基因测试暗示它们是由鱼类中记录的第一种传染性癌症引起的</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 18:40:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-strange-never-before-seen-cancer-seems-to-be-spreading-among-catfish-in-a-new-england-lake-180989195/</guid></item><item><title>危险的“火云”使法国野火更具破坏性</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/dangerous-fire-clouds-are-making-frances-wildfires-even-more-destructive-180989234/</link><description>这种在北美相当普遍的现象在法国还是第一次出现</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 18:14:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/dangerous-fire-clouds-are-making-frances-wildfires-even-more-destructive-180989234/</guid></item><item><title>想与巨石阵共度独处时光吗？今年八月，幸运的游客有机会在向游客开放之前进入石圈</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/want-to-spend-some-alone-time-with-stonehenge-this-august-lucky-visitors-get-the-chance-to-enter-the-stone-circle-before-the-site-opens-to-tourists-180989229/</link><description>下个月几乎每天，英格兰史前地标的管理人员都会抽出一张中奖彩票，并在每日忙碌开始之前为游客提供独特的体验</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 18:02:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/want-to-spend-some-alone-time-with-stonehenge-this-august-lucky-visitors-get-the-chance-to-enter-the-stone-circle-before-the-site-opens-to-tourists-180989229/</guid></item><item><title>一名男子发现了一个从地面直立的神秘金属物体。原来是一把有2700年历史的剑</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-man-unearthed-a-mysterious-metal-object-sticking-straight-up-from-the-ground-it-turned-out-to-be-a-2700-year-old-sword-180989232/</link><description>马尔钦·维希涅夫斯基 (Marcin Wiśniewski) 在波兰格但斯克市附近的森林中进行金属探测时发现了这把武器。专家告诉他，这可能可以追溯到公元前 900 年至 700 年之间</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 17:01:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-man-unearthed-a-mysterious-metal-object-sticking-straight-up-from-the-ground-it-turned-out-to-be-a-2700-year-old-sword-180989232/</guid></item><item><title>新研究表明，长期暴露于道路交通噪音可能会增加患帕金森病的风险</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/long-term-exposure-to-road-traffic-noise-might-increase-your-risk-of-developing-parkinsons-disease-new-research-suggests-180989216/</link><description>一项研究在 18 年间对丹麦 310 万成年人进行了调查，发现存在适度但一致的相关性。研究结果表明，破坏性的环境声音是脑部疾病的一个可靠的危险因素</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 15:30:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/long-term-exposure-to-road-traffic-noise-might-increase-your-risk-of-developing-parkinsons-disease-new-research-suggests-180989216/</guid></item><item><title>毁灭恐龙的小行星撞击可能已将我们的星球变成了地狱般的地狱，在数小时内烧焦了大多数生物</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-dino-killing-asteroid-strike-may-have-transformed-our-planet-into-a-hellish-inferno-charbroiling-most-creatures-within-hours-180989226/</link><description>根据计算机模拟和地质证据，科学家们提出，这一致命事件可能导致了全球野火和大气中滞留的热量，烤焦了任何无法快速躲避的动物</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-dino-killing-asteroid-strike-may-have-transformed-our-planet-into-a-hellish-inferno-charbroiling-most-creatures-within-hours-180989226/</guid></item><item><title>澳大利亚最臭名昭著的沉船残骸讲述了 17 世纪谋杀、奴隶制、叛乱以及“令人惊讶的复杂”贸易的故事</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/australias-most-notorious-shipwreck-tells-a-story-of-murder-slavery-mutiny-and-now-surprisingly-sophisticated-trade-in-the-17th-century-180989227/</link><description>1629 年，荷兰东印度公司的旗舰“巴达维亚”号沉没，船舱内装有巨大的雕刻砂岩块。这些宝石现在正在为全球资本主义黎明时期的贸易带来光明</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/australias-most-notorious-shipwreck-tells-a-story-of-murder-slavery-mutiny-and-now-surprisingly-sophisticated-trade-in-the-17th-century-180989227/</guid></item><item><title>这个太平洋岛屿消失在海平面上升之下。标志着该地点的新雕塑将演变成海鸟、珊瑚和海洋生物的家园</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-pacific-island-disappeared-under-rising-seas-a-new-sculpture-marking-the-spot-will-morph-into-a-home-for-seabirds-coral-and-marine-life-180989223/</link><description>“所罗门海妖”纪念十年前被淹没的所罗门群岛的羽衣甘蓝岛</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 19:53:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-pacific-island-disappeared-under-rising-seas-a-new-sculpture-marking-the-spot-will-morph-into-a-home-for-seabirds-coral-and-marine-life-180989223/</guid></item><item><title>参观阿布扎比波斯湾沿岸拔地而起的新弗兰克·盖里大楼，里面藏有全球艺术收藏品</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/see-the-new-frank-gehry-building-rising-from-the-shore-of-the-persian-gulf-in-abu-dhabi-to-house-a-global-art-collection-180989224/</link><description>官员们刚刚宣布阿布扎比古根海姆博物馆将于 12 月开幕，这是古根海姆基金会艺术博物馆阵容中期待已久的第四座博物馆</description><p